:: Avatar Display Waist [nobr]

<<if $ADBottoms.Type == "Shorts" or $ADBottoms.Type == "Jeans" or $ADBottoms.Type == "Slacks" or $ADBottoms.Type == "Cargo Shorts" or $ADBottoms.Type == "Dress Shorts">>

	<<if $ADWaist.AvatarAlt != "None">>
